{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026BwUPHk3Cvl1793105004.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>2026胡潤百富榜出爐，字節跳動創辦人張一鳴第二度成為中國首富。</p><p></p><p>43歲的張一鳴受惠於人工智能(AI)業務，推動公司估值，他的財富亦增長2,000億元人民幣，以6,700億元身家成為中國首富，並刷新了中國首富的財富紀錄，他於2024年首次登上榜首。</p><p></p><p>而DEEPSEEK創辦人梁文鋒首次進入前十位，以2,800億元財富排第七。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.RICH-2000_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026SsmKuEdoz81793105027.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>內地傳媒指當前的人工智能浪潮，批量造就億萬富豪，財富增長最多的前十位企業家主要來自人工智能及半導體行業。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T13:02:03.028863+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":215,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T11:39:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T13:18:20.556995+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T12:58:28.202283+00:00","content_hash":"708f422d0d6ed6832b6565b64e19287f0d60ea0d5d6dff924effb017da237c9d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T13:02:03.028863+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}